(1582328, 212688, 37893, '<td valign="top">Paris let you borrow Tinkerbell for this shot? Very humorous :) Thanks for the giggle you let me have tonight :)</td>', 'Paris let you borrow Tinkerbell for this shot? Very humorous :) Thanks for the giggle you let me have tonight :)', '2005-08-03 02:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582329, 211469, 13688, '<td valign="top">very crisp pic.  this was very well lit or you used your flash to perfection.  wish you had done more with the composition or angle as it just feels like you''re piggy backing off of the artist''s work.</td>', 'very crisp pic.  this was very well lit or you used your flash to perfection.  wish you had done more with the composition or angle as it just feels like you''re piggy backing off of the artist''s work.', '2005-08-03 02:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582330, 211234, 40718, '<td valign="top">ok, this isn''t too bad.  Maybe you are lucky I''ve seen a string of poor pics.</td>', 'ok, this isn''t too bad.  Maybe you are lucky I''ve seen a string of poor pics.', '2005-08-03 02:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582332, 209743, 40718, '<td valign="top">pixelated...</td>', 'pixelated...', '2005-08-03 02:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582333, 211262, 37893, '<td valign="top">For interior shots, the plant has to go. it''s quite distracting and takes away from the flow of the eyes in and around the image. I would have probably oriented the blinds the other side so that strange lighting isn''t cast on that big glossy artwork to the right.</td>', 'For interior shots, the plant has to go. it''s quite distracting and takes away from the flow of the eyes in and around the image. I would have probably oriented the blinds the other side so that strange lighting isn''t cast on that big glossy artwork to the right.', '2005-08-03 02:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582335, 212851, 40718, '<td valign="top">Heh, ok, for the creative shots, I like the "outside the box" feel of this.  It is originial yet still says "affluence".</td>', 'Heh, ok, for the creative shots, I like the "outside the box" feel of this.  It is originial yet still says "affluence".', '2005-08-03 02:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582336, 212012, 41626, '<td valign="top">very cool picture! i like the bluish hue and the vertical angle of the crystals. maybe cropping off the black candlelights would give it an even more interesting approach.</td>', 'very cool picture! i like the bluish hue and the vertical angle of the crystals. maybe cropping off the black candlelights would give it an even more interesting approach.', '2005-08-03 02:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582338, 212810, 40718, '<td valign="top">better than many of the other dozen emblem shots...but suffers from lack of creativity.</td>', 'better than many of the other dozen emblem shots...but suffers from lack of creativity.', '2005-08-03 02:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582339, 211823, 37893, '<td valign="top">Sweet! A cobra! This is a fun shot with all the colors. Maybe a tighter crop would have been better.</td>', 'Sweet! A cobra! This is a fun shot with all the colors. Maybe a tighter crop would have been better.', '2005-08-03 02:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582343, 212903, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer the bill be in focus...</td>', 'I''d prefer the bill be in focus...', '2005-08-03 02:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582345, 212642, 40718, '<td valign="top">ya, I think this pic speaks "affluence" better than most I''ve seen so far...</td>', 'ya, I think this pic speaks "affluence" better than most I''ve seen so far...', '2005-08-03 02:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582346, 212956, 12583, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this shot better without the man in it. I guess I don''t "get" why he''s in there or what he brings to the picture...</td>', 'I would have liked this shot better without the man in it. I guess I don''t "get" why he''s in there or what he brings to the picture...', '2005-08-03 02:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582348, 212845, 41626, '<td valign="top">very interesting!-i like the approach of adding in the stallion on the wall. i like the reflection and the overall hue of your photo.</td>', 'very interesting!-i like the approach of adding in the stallion on the wall. i like the reflection and the overall hue of your photo.', '2005-08-03 02:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582349, 212835, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is better than the guy who used ones for his background...</td>', 'This is better than the guy who used ones for his background...', '2005-08-03 02:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582350, 211408, 27164, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This pictures is stunning, and i love the effect made by putting the sun in the fram like you did, this is just beautiful....One of my favorites of the challenge for sure.  Good luck!</td>', 'WOW!  This pictures is stunning, and i love the effect made by putting the sun in the fram like you did, this is just beautiful....One of my favorites of the challenge for sure.  Good luck!', '2005-08-03 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582352, 211746, 37893, '<td valign="top">This image looks like you took a photo of a modelling shoot. She isn''t posing for you it seems.</td>', 'This image looks like you took a photo of a modelling shoot. She isn''t posing for you it seems.', '2005-08-03 02:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582353, 212845, 13688, '<td valign="top">crisp pic.  i wish the car and not the horse was the center of my attention.  obviously the wall is reflecting a yellow tint but i''d like to see the car more in its true color, perhaps with some white balance adjustments or saturation adjustments in photoshop.  from seeing the horse''s reflection in the hood, i''m thinking it would have been cool to shoot just the car and see the horse on the wall as a reflection...if possible.</td>', 'crisp pic.  i wish the car and not the horse was the center of my attention.  obviously the wall is reflecting a yellow tint but i''d like to see the car more in its true color, perhaps with some white balance adjustments or saturation adjustments in photoshop.  from seeing the horse''s reflection in the hood, i''m thinking it would have been cool to shoot just the car and see the horse on the wall as a reflection...if possible.', '2005-08-03 02:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582354, 212814, 37893, '<td valign="top">Sweet!</td>', 'Sweet!', '2005-08-03 02:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582355, 212931, 40718, '<td valign="top">So why is the serial number upside down compared to the denomination?  Something just looks a bit wrong...</td>', 'So why is the serial number upside down compared to the denomination?  Something just looks a bit wrong...', '2005-08-03 02:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582356, 212836, 37252, '<td valign="top">you really need to spend the time to learn proper sizing for DPC. I''m sure your shot here will take a hit due to it''s small size.</td>', 'you really need to spend the time to learn proper sizing for DPC. I''m sure your shot here will take a hit due to it''s small size.', '2005-08-03 02:25:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1582358, 212847, 27164, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This picture is absolutely beautiful.  One of my top pics of the challenge...I love architecture shots first of all, and with a sky like this you have a killer shot!  Great job and good luck!</td>', 'WOW!  This picture is absolutely beautiful.  One of my top pics of the challenge...I love architecture shots first of all, and with a sky like this you have a killer shot!  Great job and good luck!', '2005-08-03 02:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582359, 211912, 40718, '<td valign="top">out of focus...nice ring though.</td>', 'out of focus...nice ring though.', '2005-08-03 02:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582360, 212119, 37893, '<td valign="top">The shine of the background is a bit distracting. I suggest rethinking where the lights are coming from for this shot. Was this shot inside a jewelry store? Diamonds are indeed a sign of affluence.</td>', 'The shine of the background is a bit distracting. I suggest rethinking where the lights are coming from for this shot. Was this shot inside a jewelry store? Diamonds are indeed a sign of affluence.', '2005-08-03 02:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582362, 212965, 40718, '<td valign="top">cute idea, but I''d prefer it all in focus...</td>', 'cute idea, but I''d prefer it all in focus...', '2005-08-03 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582364, 212929, 30490, '<td valign="top">This was my first thought when I saw this challenge, the pool at Heart Castle (at least this is where I think you took this image). A very nice job with a tough lighting situation!</td>', 'This was my first thought when I saw this challenge, the pool at Heart Castle (at least this is where I think you took this image). A very nice job with a tough lighting situation!', '2005-08-03 02:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582365, 212639, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.</td>', 'I like the composition.', '2005-08-03 02:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582368, 211740, 30490, '<td valign="top">One of my first thoughts when I saw the topic affluence was our grocery stores here in the US.  I didn''t enter this challenge, but you brought my idea to life!  Nice phot I love the family for perspective and the abundance that is represented by your image.</td>', 'One of my first thoughts when I saw the topic affluence was our grocery stores here in the US.  I didn''t enter this challenge, but you brought my idea to life!  Nice phot I love the family for perspective and the abundance that is represented by your image.', '2005-08-03 02:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582369, 212905, 37893, '<td valign="top">The harsh lighting prevents one from seeing the "Midas" effect.</td>', 'The harsh lighting prevents one from seeing the "Midas" effect.', '2005-08-03 02:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582370, 212836, 13688, '<td valign="top">always nice to see some new shots of tampa bay.  perhaps you won''t get discouraged and next one will be shown a bit larger.</td>', 'always nice to see some new shots of tampa bay.  perhaps you won''t get discouraged and next one will be shown a bit larger.', '2005-08-03 02:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582372, 212753, 30490, '<td valign="top">Hot spot and reflection destroy this image.  Keep trying in future challenges</td>', 'Hot spot and reflection destroy this image.  Keep trying in future challenges', '2005-08-03 02:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582373, 212936, 27164, '<td valign="top">Good solid landscape shot.  Looks like a postcard - great job.  I would like to see a bit more sky above the mountains though</td>', 'Good solid landscape shot.  Looks like a postcard - great job.  I would like to see a bit more sky above the mountains though', '2005-08-03 02:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582374, 212652, 3669, '<td valign="top">The reflections are very bothersome.  Also, should have taken the sun visor from the windshield.</td>', 'The reflections are very bothersome.  Also, should have taken the sun visor from the windshield.', '2005-08-03 02:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582375, 212523, 30490, '<td valign="top">Oops, was this a mistake?  I''m sure you didn''t mean to enter a completely unrelated out of focus image in this challenge.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'Oops, was this a mistake?  I''m sure you didn''t mean to enter a completely unrelated out of focus image in this challenge.  Better luck next time.', '2005-08-03 02:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582376, 212834, 37893, '<td valign="top">Your frame''s on steroids! Ease up on the border and this would have been a nice shot.</td>', 'Your frame''s on steroids! Ease up on the border and this would have been a nice shot.', '2005-08-03 02:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582378, 212836, 37893, '<td valign="top">Maximize the 640x640 max size. One can''t really see anything  unfortunately.</td>', 'Maximize the 640x640 max size. One can''t really see anything  unfortunately.', '2005-08-03 02:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582380, 212830, 30490, '<td valign="top">Your image is too small to see any detail.  Check out the tutorial about how to prepare photos for DPC before you submit in the next challenge.</td>', 'Your image is too small to see any detail.  Check out the tutorial about how to prepare photos for DPC before you submit in the next challenge.', '2005-08-03 02:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582383, 212906, 35467, '<td valign="top">very cool machine, but from a photographic point of view the reflections are just too much in my opinion. Good luck</td>', 'very cool machine, but from a photographic point of view the reflections are just too much in my opinion. Good luck', '2005-08-03 02:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
