(1582385, 212459, 30490, '<td valign="top">Are you sure this isn''t a marketing photo that you took a second photo of???  If it is your image it had potential but the reflection really killed the image.</td>', 'Are you sure this isn''t a marketing photo that you took a second photo of???  If it is your image it had potential but the reflection really killed the image.', '2005-08-03 02:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
