(1582388, 212153, 3669, '<td valign="top">All my eyes land on is the model''s hair.  The lighting seems to be off...at the top of her head, the hair appears greenish and toward the end, the lighting blows it out.  Her face looks sunburned.   I can hardly see any of the fur coat.  On a positive note, the model is pretty and has a very nice, pleasent smile.</td>', 'All my eyes land on is the model''s hair.  The lighting seems to be off...at the top of her head, the hair appears greenish and toward the end, the lighting blows it out.  Her face looks sunburned.   I can hardly see any of the fur coat.  On a positive note, the model is pretty and has a very nice, pleasent smile.', '2005-08-03 02:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
