(1582404, 212754, 30490, '<td valign="top">On the right track here, but the washed out nature of the image loses the impact to the viewer.  If the jewels were sharp and crisp I think you would really be on to something here.</td>', 'On the right track here, but the washed out nature of the image loses the impact to the viewer.  If the jewels were sharp and crisp I think you would really be on to something here.', '2005-08-03 02:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582405, 212617, 30490, '<td valign="top">Affluence?</td>', 'Affluence?', '2005-08-03 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582407, 212685, 30490, '<td valign="top">Your image is too small to see any detail.  Check out the tutorial about how to prepare photos for DPC before you submit in the next challenge.</td>', 'Your image is too small to see any detail.  Check out the tutorial about how to prepare photos for DPC before you submit in the next challenge.', '2005-08-03 02:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582410, 209776, 30490, '<td valign="top">To out of focus for my taste</td>', 'To out of focus for my taste', '2005-08-03 02:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582411, 210951, 3669, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful child.  I love the freckles...I hope she does too.  This picture seems to be a little over-saturated..especially in the reds.  Her face and ears look extremely sunburned and it kind of did weird things to her hair.</td>', 'What a beautiful child.  I love the freckles...I hope she does too.  This picture seems to be a little over-saturated..especially in the reds.  Her face and ears look extremely sunburned and it kind of did weird things to her hair.', '2005-08-03 02:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582412, 211307, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice nature photo but affluence?</td>', 'Nice nature photo but affluence?', '2005-08-03 02:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582413, 211827, 29269, '<td valign="top">Not lucky with the weather - the clouds over Frost tower take away from the supposed message of affluence, they are more of an indication of instability in the global economy.. or at least I see it that way.<br/> <br/>Another little thing that is distracting is the perspective and the distortion of edges caused by the angle of the shoot. Being farther away would have alleviated this issue.<br/> <br/> Still a powerful shot, and in the upper half of the challenge for now.</td>', 'Not lucky with the weather - the clouds over Frost tower take away from the supposed message of affluence, they are more of an indication of instability in the global economy.. or at least I see it that way. Another little thing that is distracting is the perspective and the distortion of edges caused by the angle of the shoot. Being farther away would have alleviated this issue.  Still a powerful shot, and in the upper half of the challenge for now.', '2005-08-03 02:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582414, 212798, 30490, '<td valign="top">Affluence? I don''t get how this ties in.  The image is also too grainy and out of focus.</td>', 'Affluence? I don''t get how this ties in.  The image is also too grainy and out of focus.', '2005-08-03 02:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582415, 212384, 30490, '<td valign="top">Too blurry for my taste</td>', 'Too blurry for my taste', '2005-08-03 02:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582416, 209743, 30490, '<td valign="top">Too blurry and grainy for my taste, but the colors are lovely and the subject is a very pretty young woman.</td>', 'Too blurry and grainy for my taste, but the colors are lovely and the subject is a very pretty young woman.', '2005-08-03 02:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582417, 212961, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the concept.  it took a few seconds for me to decipher it was a penny.  your processing kind of led me too that problem.  the texture of the ground you''ve chosen is kind of distracting as well.  also you have alot of open foreground that isn''t doing your shot any justice.  i''ll stop now as this is probably going to score higher than mine ;)</td>', 'i like the concept.  it took a few seconds for me to decipher it was a penny.  your processing kind of led me too that problem.  the texture of the ground you''ve chosen is kind of distracting as well.  also you have alot of open foreground that isn''t doing your shot any justice.  i''ll stop now as this is probably going to score higher than mine ;)', '2005-08-03 02:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582418, 210736, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, I''m glad that someone read the rules of the challenge! 10. If I could give you an 11 I would!</td>', 'Beautiful photo, I''m glad that someone read the rules of the challenge! 10. If I could give you an 11 I would!', '2005-08-03 02:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
