(1582583, 211032, 3669, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems rather harsh.  Also there is a yellow color cast which is not very appealing.  Could use better focus.  Interesting composition and cute little apple, however, I''m not sure I understand how it relates to the challenge.</td>', 'Lighting seems rather harsh.  Also there is a yellow color cast which is not very appealing.  Could use better focus.  Interesting composition and cute little apple, however, I''m not sure I understand how it relates to the challenge.', '2005-08-03 03:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582585, 212614, 39675, '<td valign="top">To me, this is not any easy shot with a dark car and bright white-ish background where there is bright sun on the buildings and not on the car, but you pulled it off.  I''m  not an expert in composition, but for my taste I like the picture just a bit more with out so much of the foreground.  To me croping a bit more make the care feel like it is turely mounted high.  The fact that I''m commenting means I like the photo.</td>', 'To me, this is not any easy shot with a dark car and bright white-ish background where there is bright sun on the buildings and not on the car, but you pulled it off.  I''m  not an expert in composition, but for my taste I like the picture just a bit more with out so much of the foreground.  To me croping a bit more make the care feel like it is turely mounted high.  The fact that I''m commenting means I like the photo.', '2005-08-03 03:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1582586, 212866, 3669, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Nice creativity.  I don''t really like the narrow DOF in this picture.</td>', 'Cute!  Nice creativity.  I don''t really like the narrow DOF in this picture.', '2005-08-03 03:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
