(1583027, 211942, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this wouild be really effective if placed on a black or white background/counter and done with a black and white filter.  Then it would really jump out at you. I find the brown woven cloth to be kind of distracting. I''d place the coiled belt completely in the shot and not cropped out on the left with plenty of negative space to the right. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'I think this wouild be really effective if placed on a black or white background/counter and done with a black and white filter.  Then it would really jump out at you. I find the brown woven cloth to be kind of distracting. I''d place the coiled belt completely in the shot and not cropped out on the left with plenty of negative space to the right. Hope this is helpful.', '2005-08-03 09:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
