(1583033, 212835, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think with a staged shot like this, you really have to have a POW factor, or it just kind of gets lost. I think it might have been more effectibe to have the bracelets not so perfectly "S"ed. Or maybe do it in black and white with a ton of contrast.  Hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'I think with a staged shot like this, you really have to have a POW factor, or it just kind of gets lost. I think it might have been more effectibe to have the bracelets not so perfectly "S"ed. Or maybe do it in black and white with a ton of contrast.  Hope you find this helpful.', '2005-08-03 09:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
