(1583035, 212004, 26633, '<td valign="top">Arranging items for a still life is never easy but here the photographer has made the arrangement look so natural and casual I can almost believe it is real. The depth of field is perfect for the job and so is the black andwhite treatment. 9 from me.</td>', 'Arranging items for a still life is never easy but here the photographer has made the arrangement look so natural and casual I can almost believe it is real. The depth of field is perfect for the job and so is the black andwhite treatment. 9 from me.', '2005-08-03 09:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
