(1583213, 212481, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked this more without the rings, although I know that''s part of the title. Diamonds and cut stones are so hard to capture without them looking overdone, or on the other side of that, blurred. But that being said, the composition is nice and I like that you sat them on a mirrored surface. I like the greenish/brown filter as well.</td>', 'I''d have liked this more without the rings, although I know that''s part of the title. Diamonds and cut stones are so hard to capture without them looking overdone, or on the other side of that, blurred. But that being said, the composition is nice and I like that you sat them on a mirrored surface. I like the greenish/brown filter as well.', '2005-08-03 10:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1583215, 210834, 38592, '<td valign="top">HA HA HA... although the quality of this pic is not the best it still is a great shot due to the humor.  Great capture.</td>', 'HA HA HA... although the quality of this pic is not the best it still is a great shot due to the humor.  Great capture.', '2005-08-03 10:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
