(1583529, 212523, 13879, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid you are going to get hammered for this! Assuming you are not taking the mickey and going for brown, try making you images bigger (you can go up to 640 x 640) and really try and make sure your focus is spot on. If you did that here I''d have give you a 6-7, as I think your composition is nice. Good luck in future challenges, dont get put off!</td>', 'I''m afraid you are going to get hammered for this! Assuming you are not taking the mickey and going for brown, try making you images bigger (you can go up to 640 x 640) and really try and make sure your focus is spot on. If you did that here I''d have give you a 6-7, as I think your composition is nice. Good luck in future challenges, dont get put off!', '2005-08-03 11:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
