(1585771, 212642, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not the best of show photo but certainly the best of show idea. I have always been an idea guy. Congratulations on a unique and fitting challenge entry!!!!! My top pic.</td>', 'Not the best of show photo but certainly the best of show idea. I have always been an idea guy. Congratulations on a unique and fitting challenge entry!!!!! My top pic.', '2005-08-04 01:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585783, 209811, 18197, '<td valign="top">Choose your own comment:<br/>1) The soft focus &amp; over saturated colors really don''t resonate with me. My counsel would be to back off on post processing ... where I believe less is more ... and let your camera do the focusing for you. Your title is a bit obscure as well. Sorry to be negative.<br/> <br/>2) I assume you are trying to convey the chemically induced state of "way too drunk to drive ... or even walk" to which my reaction would be, "Nice capture!"</td>', 'Choose your own comment:1) The soft focus & over saturated colors really don''t resonate with me. My counsel would be to back off on post processing ... where I believe less is more ... and let your camera do the focusing for you. Your title is a bit obscure as well. Sorry to be negative. 2) I assume you are trying to convey the chemically induced state of "way too drunk to drive ... or even walk" to which my reaction would be, "Nice capture!"', '2005-08-04 01:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585789, 211325, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! Among my top 3 picks this challenge. <br/> <br/>If we had advanced editing available, you could have done something with the scenery outside the window which is a bit of a distraction and dampens the mood of the carriage.<br/> <br/>This would have ben a dynamite entry for Time Capsul as well! Title: 1923</td>', 'Beautifully done! Among my top 3 picks this challenge.  If we had advanced editing available, you could have done something with the scenery outside the window which is a bit of a distraction and dampens the mood of the carriage. This would have ben a dynamite entry for Time Capsul as well! Title: 1923', '2005-08-04 01:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585792, 212846, 18197, '<td valign="top">I grew up in a place where this kind of spread was true affluence. It may be my history and personal experience, but I believe you have captured very well the notion of Western Affluence. Outstanding photo. Among my top 3 picks.<br/> <br/>If I had a nit to pick, and if we had advanced editing available, lightening the forest just slightly would have increased the contrast with the logs and made this an eye poppingly great photo.</td>', 'I grew up in a place where this kind of spread was true affluence. It may be my history and personal experience, but I believe you have captured very well the notion of Western Affluence. Outstanding photo. Among my top 3 picks. If I had a nit to pick, and if we had advanced editing available, lightening the forest just slightly would have increased the contrast with the logs and made this an eye poppingly great photo.', '2005-08-04 01:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585860, 212929, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice composition and lighting, fits the theme</td>', 'nice composition and lighting, fits the theme', '2005-08-04 02:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585896, 212813, 31443, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image and yes no price can be put on this, affluent, yes indeed!</td>', 'What a beautiful image and yes no price can be put on this, affluent, yes indeed!', '2005-08-04 03:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585917, 211224, 31443, '<td valign="top">For some people yes, indeed!</td>', 'For some people yes, indeed!', '2005-08-04 03:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
