(1585919, 210395, 31443, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 10 for this image because where I live this is a most valuable commodity and the one´s who have it are both affluent and fortunate</td>', 'I gave you a 10 for this image because where I live this is a most valuable commodity and the one´s who have it are both affluent and fortunate', '2005-08-04 03:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
