(1585943, 212688, 21816, '<td valign="top">This is cute! I would of tried to compose it so it was more swimming pool in the background than the path and bushes on the left. But well done.</td>', 'This is cute! I would of tried to compose it so it was more swimming pool in the background than the path and bushes on the left. But well done.', '2005-08-04 04:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1585945, 212662, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great details on parts of the ceiling; love the rich red colors &amp; the angle of the shot; great title as well.<br/> <br/>A flash would have illuminated the statue in the foreground &amp; made it more a part of the photo instead of standing out from it, &amp; I wish the skylights weren''t blown out (I''m sure you''re going to hear a lot of that...), but this is still a creative &amp; well executed take on the challenge. - 7.</td>', 'Great details on parts of the ceiling; love the rich red colors & the angle of the shot; great title as well. A flash would have illuminated the statue in the foreground & made it more a part of the photo instead of standing out from it, & I wish the skylights weren''t blown out (I''m sure you''re going to hear a lot of that...), but this is still a creative & well executed take on the challenge. - 7.', '2005-08-04 04:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
