(1585952, 211746, 38476, '<td valign="top">Good choice to include the lady in your photo. Her body language speaks volumes about the pride and arrogance that normally accompany wealth. - 8.</td>', 'Good choice to include the lady in your photo. Her body language speaks volumes about the pride and arrogance that normally accompany wealth. - 8.', '2005-08-04 04:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
