(1585970, 212688, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I love so many things about it: the plastic fishes, the pink flamingo, the pink wicker chair,  the chihuahua''s outfit... It''s all in harmony with the idea of the super-rich who pamper their pets extravagantly.<br/> <br/>My only major complaint would be about the path &amp; fence in the background. Maybe angling the photo more to the pool would have worked better...</td>', 'Great photo! I love so many things about it: the plastic fishes, the pink flamingo, the pink wicker chair,  the chihuahua''s outfit... It''s all in harmony with the idea of the super-rich who pamper their pets extravagantly. My only major complaint would be about the path & fence in the background. Maybe angling the photo more to the pool would have worked better...', '2005-08-04 04:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
