(1586026, 212642, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great photo. All the parts of this photo work well together - the BMW, the fact that it''s a convertible, the hat, the sunglasses, the hair, the expression. My first 10 in this challenge so far. <br/> <br/>I think this photo deserves to ribbon. The only two things that might keep it out are the background (you''ve got a reasonable background, but the parking sign &amp; the little red house don''t scream money - part of a park that your audience could be tricked into thinking are the grounds of a luxury mansion would have worked) &amp; the lack of a designer label on the handbag (I''d have loved to have seen a Dolce &amp; Gabbana or Yves Saint Laurent in her hands, but they''re kinda expensive as props for a photo).<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge &amp; well done on a really great photo!</td>', 'Great photo. All the parts of this photo work well together - the BMW, the fact that it''s a convertible, the hat, the sunglasses, the hair, the expression. My first 10 in this challenge so far.  I think this photo deserves to ribbon. The only two things that might keep it out are the background (you''ve got a reasonable background, but the parking sign & the little red house don''t scream money - part of a park that your audience could be tricked into thinking are the grounds of a luxury mansion would have worked) & the lack of a designer label on the handbag (I''d have loved to have seen a Dolce & Gabbana or Yves Saint Laurent in her hands, but they''re kinda expensive as props for a photo). Good luck in the challenge & well done on a really great photo!', '2005-08-04 05:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
