(1588185, 212033, 3669, '<td valign="top">You know, I had a bet with myself that we would see money toliet paper in this challenge and here it is.  By the way, I won the bet :-)  You know, I would have liked to see the roll a little closer up I think.  Other than that, technically this picture is well done IMO.</td>', 'You know, I had a bet with myself that we would see money toliet paper in this challenge and here it is.  By the way, I won the bet :-)  You know, I would have liked to see the roll a little closer up I think.  Other than that, technically this picture is well done IMO.', '2005-08-05 03:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
