(1588191, 212510, 3669, '<td valign="top">I would call this priceless.  Lovely shot!!  I really like the lighting.  The B&amp;W skin tones against the light background is great.  Good job!!  10</td>', 'I would call this priceless.  Lovely shot!!  I really like the lighting.  The B&W skin tones against the light background is great.  Good job!!  10', '2005-08-05 03:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
