(1588214, 210989, 35545, '<td valign="top">Pleasant looking old house.  The plastic pool doesn''t add much.</td>', 'Pleasant looking old house.  The plastic pool doesn''t add much.', '2005-08-05 03:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588215, 210767, 3669, '<td valign="top">I was so nice of him to pose so well for you.  Excellent composition and colors.  They must the floor of his enclosure painted blue.  I don''t like the blue line and the blue colored reflections on his fur.  Since this is an advanced edit challenge, I would have gotten rid of the blues and possible cyans as well....or even made it B&amp;W, although the colors in the background are kind of nice.  I think it could also use just a little tad more of contrast.</td>', 'I was so nice of him to pose so well for you.  Excellent composition and colors.  They must the floor of his enclosure painted blue.  I don''t like the blue line and the blue colored reflections on his fur.  Since this is an advanced edit challenge, I would have gotten rid of the blues and possible cyans as well....or even made it B&W, although the colors in the background are kind of nice.  I think it could also use just a little tad more of contrast.', '2005-08-05 03:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588236, 211906, 31213, '<td valign="top">Material wealth is what money can buy, not money itself....Also, the focus could be a bit sharper and the composition takes away from the power of the bills....I''d like to see a little more....or stacked differently to look like theres more there.  Just my two cents....plz...by all means....take it with a grain of salt.  :)</td>', 'Material wealth is what money can buy, not money itself....Also, the focus could be a bit sharper and the composition takes away from the power of the bills....I''d like to see a little more....or stacked differently to look like theres more there.  Just my two cents....plz...by all means....take it with a grain of salt.  :)', '2005-08-05 04:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588242, 212510, 31213, '<td valign="top">Material wealth?  Nice shot but not very fitting to this challenge in my opinion...also, I though maybe, just MAYBE the title could pull it through as an "abstract" interpretation of the topic (material wealth)....but when I read your title it didn''t lead me to this at all.  Your title is "Loving Touch"....this is a direct and literal title that, if anything aside from the literal interpretation, could represent love, nuture, or relationships....NOT material wealth.</td>', 'Material wealth?  Nice shot but not very fitting to this challenge in my opinion...also, I though maybe, just MAYBE the title could pull it through as an "abstract" interpretation of the topic (material wealth)....but when I read your title it didn''t lead me to this at all.  Your title is "Loving Touch"....this is a direct and literal title that, if anything aside from the literal interpretation, could represent love, nuture, or relationships....NOT material wealth.', '2005-08-05 04:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588243, 212688, 31213, '<td valign="top">Loved the effort for the challenge! :)</td>', 'Loved the effort for the challenge! :)', '2005-08-05 04:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
