(1588248, 212956, 31213, '<td valign="top">LOVE it!  I wonder if you''re the same person that took the blury walkby in the long exposure challenge....same style and appeal.  Nice work. 10!</td>', 'LOVE it!  I wonder if you''re the same person that took the blury walkby in the long exposure challenge....same style and appeal.  Nice work. 10!', '2005-08-05 04:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
