(1588727, 212901, 18870, '<td valign="top">cool shot.... you should have used a more expensive ball for the challenge tho :)  but I gave you an 8 anyway.</td>', 'cool shot.... you should have used a more expensive ball for the challenge tho :)  but I gave you an 8 anyway.', '2005-08-05 12:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588731, 210834, 38032, '<td valign="top">how many points for funny? ... Great capture -- and (fortunately) lacking the details of a "perfect" photograph.  8</td>', 'how many points for funny? ... Great capture -- and (fortunately) lacking the details of a "perfect" photograph.  8', '2005-08-05 12:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588737, 210951, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is a great picture of an absolutely adorable subject, but for the life of me i can not relate it to the affluence challenge which was required to "Knock us out with your representation of material wealth" - so, i am just leaving you this comment and refrain from voting on it at all...</td>', 'this is a great picture of an absolutely adorable subject, but for the life of me i can not relate it to the affluence challenge which was required to "Knock us out with your representation of material wealth" - so, i am just leaving you this comment and refrain from voting on it at all...', '2005-08-05 12:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588743, 212800, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the spontaneous look to this shot - the woman with the hair in her hands as well as the woman in the foreground.  Nice work.  8</td>', 'I like the spontaneous look to this shot - the woman with the hair in her hands as well as the woman in the foreground.  Nice work.  8', '2005-08-05 12:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588754, 212523, 38032, '<td valign="top">I am confused by this image.  It would be easy to score as a 1 or 2 because it is small, has no focus and is barely even legible. I would guess that this was some sort of statement about affluence if it had anything to make we think that but it doesn''t.  I''m so confused I''m giving it a 7.</td>', 'I am confused by this image.  It would be easy to score as a 1 or 2 because it is small, has no focus and is barely even legible. I would guess that this was some sort of statement about affluence if it had anything to make we think that but it doesn''t.  I''m so confused I''m giving it a 7.', '2005-08-05 12:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588756, 212312, 38032, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2005-08-05 12:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588773, 210457, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is intriquing, simple, and has great colors - the model is beautiful and well shot.  A little more contrast and perhaps a more descriptive element in the foreground would have been a 10.  8 from me. Nice.</td>', 'This is intriquing, simple, and has great colors - the model is beautiful and well shot.  A little more contrast and perhaps a more descriptive element in the foreground would have been a 10.  8 from me. Nice.', '2005-08-05 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588791, 210382, 38032, '<td valign="top">Hey - if you''re burnin'' money - send some my way!  Nice ... and funny. 6 ... Ok 7 because it''s Friday!</td>', 'Hey - if you''re burnin'' money - send some my way!  Nice ... and funny. 6 ... Ok 7 because it''s Friday!', '2005-08-05 13:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588896, 212956, 22379, '<td valign="top">i really love the character and the composition of this photo - he looks llike the typical gucci wearer too, i just wish that shutter had fired a little faster so we could see that fabulous expression clearly.</td>', 'i really love the character and the composition of this photo - he looks llike the typical gucci wearer too, i just wish that shutter had fired a little faster so we could see that fabulous expression clearly.', '2005-08-05 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588904, 210457, 26255, '<td valign="top">absolutlely gorgeous shot... I love the mood and the colors... the material wealth is reference is a bit of a stretch though.</td>', 'absolutlely gorgeous shot... I love the mood and the colors... the material wealth is reference is a bit of a stretch though.', '2005-08-05 14:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588908, 212928, 26255, '<td valign="top">Definitely shows excess material wealth, but the picture feels somewhat "snapshotish"...  lacks composition... the house is dwarfed by the foreground and background and the cropping is a bit tight on the boat.</td>', 'Definitely shows excess material wealth, but the picture feels somewhat "snapshotish"...  lacks composition... the house is dwarfed by the foreground and background and the cropping is a bit tight on the boat.', '2005-08-05 14:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588910, 212652, 26255, '<td valign="top">I love this... it has a very "in your face" attitude</td>', 'I love this... it has a very "in your face" attitude', '2005-08-05 14:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588913, 211955, 26255, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful location... I understand why you cropped it the way you did, but the result makes the house seem small in comparison to the surroundings... I''m not sure how this could have  been improved, but I feel it is lacking in punch.</td>', 'what a beautiful location... I understand why you cropped it the way you did, but the result makes the house seem small in comparison to the surroundings... I''m not sure how this could have  been improved, but I feel it is lacking in punch.', '2005-08-05 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588915, 209759, 26255, '<td valign="top">OMG... sacrilege!!!  ;)<br/> <br/>The focus seems a touch off.</td>', 'OMG... sacrilege!!!  ;) The focus seems a touch off.', '2005-08-05 14:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588923, 212913, 26255, '<td valign="top">IMHO...The gate in the foreground is very distracting and the tree on the left detracts from the house.  The background seems washed out.  Maybe a shot inside the fence (if that''s even possible) at more of an angle when the lighting is not so harsh would help.</td>', 'IMHO...The gate in the foreground is very distracting and the tree on the left detracts from the house.  The background seems washed out.  Maybe a shot inside the fence (if that''s even possible) at more of an angle when the lighting is not so harsh would help.', '2005-08-05 14:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588925, 212243, 22379, '<td valign="top">i would have scored this higher had you not postprocessed the background as you have done. For the record, i fully believe the manipulation was within the editting rules and am not making you down for "cheating", i just do not like the effect the editting resulted in. I find it to be too harsh and dark for the photo. I expect the sky to be paler than thier rich full coloured robes, but it is the blackest black of the image. A noble man in thie era would pride hiself on the darkest red of his robes, so having the sky manipulated in this way, to me, contridicts his showing of affulence.</td>', 'i would have scored this higher had you not postprocessed the background as you have done. For the record, i fully believe the manipulation was within the editting rules and am not making you down for "cheating", i just do not like the effect the editting resulted in. I find it to be too harsh and dark for the photo. I expect the sky to be paler than thier rich full coloured robes, but it is the blackest black of the image. A noble man in thie era would pride hiself on the darkest red of his robes, so having the sky manipulated in this way, to me, contridicts his showing of affulence.', '2005-08-05 14:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588926, 212662, 26255, '<td valign="top">Wow... now that''s pretentious!!!  I love it.</td>', 'Wow... now that''s pretentious!!!  I love it.', '2005-08-05 14:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1588928, 212902, 26255, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and cropping on this.... very fitting</td>', 'I love the composition and cropping on this.... very fitting', '2005-08-05 14:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
