(1589090, 212837, 16106, '<td valign="top">well capturesd shot, but the image speak more of mass conformity than affluence. If his is on a fabulous beach it might speak of wealth but it it is in a blighted urban area it might speak of poverty. as  pure abstract i like it but i don''t read it as a bastion of privalege</td>', 'well capturesd shot, but the image speak more of mass conformity than affluence. If his is on a fabulous beach it might speak of wealth but it it is in a blighted urban area it might speak of poverty. as  pure abstract i like it but i don''t read it as a bastion of privalege', '2005-08-05 16:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
