(1589448, 212144, 18349, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little bit flat in this image, but I have to give you props for eliminating glare on the crystal.  Tthe focus and DOF used are both great.  I find the angle to be good, because it adds a bit of dynamic to the shot, but the rather central placement of the watch in the frame makes it a bit less impactful.  The money in the background might have more pop if it were not one dollar bills (LOL), or if the money was a little more contrasty and brighter in color.  The shot meets the challenge, but doesn''t have the "wow" factor that most DPC voters long to see.  I would rank this image a 5 or a 6.</td>', 'The lighting is a little bit flat in this image, but I have to give you props for eliminating glare on the crystal.  Tthe focus and DOF used are both great.  I find the angle to be good, because it adds a bit of dynamic to the shot, but the rather central placement of the watch in the frame makes it a bit less impactful.  The money in the background might have more pop if it were not one dollar bills (LOL), or if the money was a little more contrasty and brighter in color.  The shot meets the challenge, but doesn''t have the "wow" factor that most DPC voters long to see.  I would rank this image a 5 or a 6.', '2005-08-05 20:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
