(1589759, 212642, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great expression.  Super attention to lighting.  And I like how the color of the purse is echoed by the background.  I''m finding the headrests take up more  of the photo''s real estate than I''d like.  Still, a nice effort.</td>', 'Great expression.  Super attention to lighting.  And I like how the color of the purse is echoed by the background.  I''m finding the headrests take up more  of the photo''s real estate than I''d like.  Still, a nice effort.', '2005-08-05 23:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
