(1589881, 212775, 33560, '<td valign="top">Living in New Jersey where  open space the size of a postage stamp is a little treasure, I see this as a monumental treasure trove.  I love the sky, the shadows cast by the clouds.  I like the tree in the lower left.  I like the crooked fence posts.  I wonder if you considered taking a shot that included the full length of the fence posts in the foreground?  I think maybe taking a wider angle, though it might diminish the mountain a little, might make the open space more glorious.  Maybe there are compelling reasons not to do that, though.</td>', 'Living in New Jersey where  open space the size of a postage stamp is a little treasure, I see this as a monumental treasure trove.  I love the sky, the shadows cast by the clouds.  I like the tree in the lower left.  I like the crooked fence posts.  I wonder if you considered taking a shot that included the full length of the fence posts in the foreground?  I think maybe taking a wider angle, though it might diminish the mountain a little, might make the open space more glorious.  Maybe there are compelling reasons not to do that, though.', '2005-08-06 00:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1589882, 212868, 37234, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I would understand this photo at all without the title. Actually, I''m still not sure I understand it, and I''m trying to be open-minded. For some, having food is wealth, I presume?</td>', 'I''m not sure I would understand this photo at all without the title. Actually, I''m still not sure I understand it, and I''m trying to be open-minded. For some, having food is wealth, I presume?', '2005-08-06 00:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
