(1589901, 212928, 33560, '<td valign="top">Daring and provocative use of negative space. I love this photo because it is one of the best lessons I''ve had here in the use of negative space since a string of tiny cow shots several months ago. Nice job.</td>', 'Daring and provocative use of negative space. I love this photo because it is one of the best lessons I''ve had here in the use of negative space since a string of tiny cow shots several months ago. Nice job.', '2005-08-06 00:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1589902, 212193, 37234, '<td valign="top">I''m certain that you must be connecting wealth of family to "affluence" and I respect that. However, I find flies to be abhorrent little creatures and can''t understand why you would want to put little "fly wings" on your cute baby!!</td>', 'I''m certain that you must be connecting wealth of family to "affluence" and I respect that. However, I find flies to be abhorrent little creatures and can''t understand why you would want to put little "fly wings" on your cute baby!!', '2005-08-06 00:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1589905, 210755, 37234, '<td valign="top">This is quite the stretch into "affluence". Did you get a lot of good shots for "long exposure" or something? LOL. It''s a great photo, but I only get the verbal "spill over" connection to affluence. The photo doesn''t do that by itself.</td>', 'This is quite the stretch into "affluence". Did you get a lot of good shots for "long exposure" or something? LOL. It''s a great photo, but I only get the verbal "spill over" connection to affluence. The photo doesn''t do that by itself.', '2005-08-06 00:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
