(1589963, 212384, 37234, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like your "out of the box" concept, but I''m not a big fan of the fact that almost all of the photo is out of focus. Additionally, I''m not 100% certain the photo conveys love. Because these are clearly dancers (I would guess professional ones), it detracts from the concept of Love, because they do this for a living.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like your "out of the box" concept, but I''m not a big fan of the fact that almost all of the photo is out of focus. Additionally, I''m not 100% certain the photo conveys love. Because these are clearly dancers (I would guess professional ones), it detracts from the concept of Love, because they do this for a living.', '2005-08-06 01:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
