(1589977, 212956, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love it!  The weird expression, the cheesy Euro-snob glasses and the blurry blue shirt just barely capable of containing the little round pot belly  -  all these things balance against those golden Gucci letters that for decades have screamed ''we cost more because only rich people can afford buy our stuff.''   There is a wonderful concinnity of logic in the elements of this photo; that matches the balance of forms, the contrast of colors, and the balance between stasis and motion.</td>', 'I love it!  The weird expression, the cheesy Euro-snob glasses and the blurry blue shirt just barely capable of containing the little round pot belly  -  all these things balance against those golden Gucci letters that for decades have screamed ''we cost more because only rich people can afford buy our stuff.''   There is a wonderful concinnity of logic in the elements of this photo; that matches the balance of forms, the contrast of colors, and the balance between stasis and motion.', '2005-08-06 01:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1589979, 212527, 37234, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting the connection between "yellow liquid with straws" and "affluence". Don''t get me wrong - it''s a nicely composed shot. I just don''t understand how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not getting the connection between "yellow liquid with straws" and "affluence". Don''t get me wrong - it''s a nicely composed shot. I just don''t understand how it meets the challenge.', '2005-08-06 01:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1589984, 212047, 37234, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... that poor carpenter may indeed see this stack of wood as "wealth". Then again, he may just see it as an insurmountable mountain of "work"!!</td>', 'Hmmm... that poor carpenter may indeed see this stack of wood as "wealth". Then again, he may just see it as an insurmountable mountain of "work"!!', '2005-08-06 01:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
