(1590002, 212523, 37234, '<td valign="top">I certainly don''t mean to offend you, but I can''t see the possible link to affluence in this photo because nothing is in focus!</td>', 'I certainly don''t mean to offend you, but I can''t see the possible link to affluence in this photo because nothing is in focus!', '2005-08-06 01:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590016, 212688, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very funny. I guess you tried the sunglasses but they did not quite work out?  In any case, it''s always fun to relax by the pool with one''s friends.  The pink theme works nicely  I find the background - though carefully obscured by close cropping  and good control of DOF - to be a little distracting. And I find the wealth of objects to be a little overwhelming.  <br/> <br/>I think the biggest problem with the photo is that the dog seems to be having much less fun than the photographer.  In fact he looks both a little irked by the effort and peeved by the fact that there is not much he can do to get out of it.  Or maybe he is just dreaming pensively of that French poodle he met  at some other pool party long ago.</td>', 'Very funny. I guess you tried the sunglasses but they did not quite work out?  In any case, it''s always fun to relax by the pool with one''s friends.  The pink theme works nicely  I find the background - though carefully obscured by close cropping  and good control of DOF - to be a little distracting. And I find the wealth of objects to be a little overwhelming.   I think the biggest problem with the photo is that the dog seems to be having much less fun than the photographer.  In fact he looks both a little irked by the effort and peeved by the fact that there is not much he can do to get out of it.  Or maybe he is just dreaming pensively of that French poodle he met  at some other pool party long ago.', '2005-08-06 01:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590037, 212839, 33560, '<td valign="top">The idea is clever.  The crisp focus is very nicely done.   I like seeing the color of the sky and the pattern of the iris in the eye.   The pink tone, however,  is overwhelming.  You might have considered desaturating red and magenta a little bit in post processing.  <br/> <br/>It''s a quibble, but I think the concept would be much stronger if the dollar sign were not backwards.  This could have been done with some forethought. On the other hand, It is not clear to me that the photo would suffere from wholesale left-to-right reversal.  Still, quite a nice effort.</td>', 'The idea is clever.  The crisp focus is very nicely done.   I like seeing the color of the sky and the pattern of the iris in the eye.   The pink tone, however,  is overwhelming.  You might have considered desaturating red and magenta a little bit in post processing.   It''s a quibble, but I think the concept would be much stronger if the dollar sign were not backwards.  This could have been done with some forethought. On the other hand, It is not clear to me that the photo would suffere from wholesale left-to-right reversal.  Still, quite a nice effort.', '2005-08-06 01:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590052, 212625, 33560, '<td valign="top">Is that what the German Shepherd is saying?  The crisp detail and the lovely light here are exquisite.  Super choice going with black and white.  This is a really tough composition to pull off but you have done it with aplomb.  The more I look at the photo, the more I see ways in which it''s inherent clutter could have turned it into a muddled disaster, but I also see how some combination of great skill and luck has pulled everything together.  Super Effort.</td>', 'Is that what the German Shepherd is saying?  The crisp detail and the lovely light here are exquisite.  Super choice going with black and white.  This is a really tough composition to pull off but you have done it with aplomb.  The more I look at the photo, the more I see ways in which it''s inherent clutter could have turned it into a muddled disaster, but I also see how some combination of great skill and luck has pulled everything together.  Super Effort.', '2005-08-06 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590053, 211307, 36102, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, though I''m not sure if it fits into material wealth</td>', 'I like the idea here, though I''m not sure if it fits into material wealth', '2005-08-06 01:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590056, 212689, 36102, '<td valign="top">all the reflections are distracting</td>', 'all the reflections are distracting', '2005-08-06 01:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590061, 212197, 36102, '<td valign="top">wealth in the making.  Very nice view point, amazingly level crops.</td>', 'wealth in the making.  Very nice view point, amazingly level crops.', '2005-08-06 01:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590067, 210893, 36102, '<td valign="top">the skin tone looks washed out</td>', 'the skin tone looks washed out', '2005-08-06 01:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590070, 211240, 36102, '<td valign="top">the reflections are distraction as well as the paper in the window</td>', 'the reflections are distraction as well as the paper in the window', '2005-08-06 01:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590071, 211703, 36102, '<td valign="top">would love to see the color of the stained glass</td>', 'would love to see the color of the stained glass', '2005-08-06 01:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590072, 212845, 33560, '<td valign="top">Cathcing the reflection in the hood was a nice choice.  Even if the room was that golden tone, it feels just a litte oppressive to me - a little desat might help.  While this may be the right level of sharpness at which to print the photo, I think it looks a little unsharp for monitor presentation.  And curiously, even though the stallion is anything but static, the framing of the horse left to right has a static effect. It feels static.  Still, this is a nicely observed shot; and the treatment is solid.</td>', 'Cathcing the reflection in the hood was a nice choice.  Even if the room was that golden tone, it feels just a litte oppressive to me - a little desat might help.  While this may be the right level of sharpness at which to print the photo, I think it looks a little unsharp for monitor presentation.  And curiously, even though the stallion is anything but static, the framing of the horse left to right has a static effect. It feels static.  Still, this is a nicely observed shot; and the treatment is solid.', '2005-08-06 01:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590075, 212813, 36102, '<td valign="top">excellent rays.  Not sure how this is material wealth though</td>', 'excellent rays.  Not sure how this is material wealth though', '2005-08-06 01:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590082, 212375, 36102, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, that wall is just so ugly though</td>', 'i like the idea, that wall is just so ugly though', '2005-08-06 01:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590087, 212382, 33560, '<td valign="top">What gloriously provocative expressions!   Each is from a totally disparate emotional space.  One might mount a heap of trivial quibbles about shadows being too strong or the background being just a tad distracting; but those three faces overbalance any hypothetical weaknesses a dozen times over.  Very Very Nice.</td>', 'What gloriously provocative expressions!   Each is from a totally disparate emotional space.  One might mount a heap of trivial quibbles about shadows being too strong or the background being just a tad distracting; but those three faces overbalance any hypothetical weaknesses a dozen times over.  Very Very Nice.', '2005-08-06 01:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590088, 209735, 36102, '<td valign="top">looks more like something i would see on ebay.  feels very snapshotish.</td>', 'looks more like something i would see on ebay.  feels very snapshotish.', '2005-08-06 01:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590248, 210824, 3669, '<td valign="top">Can I have a loan?  Very nice picture.  Good composition and interesting DOF.  Meets challenge well.  Good job - 10</td>', 'Can I have a loan?  Very nice picture.  Good composition and interesting DOF.  Meets challenge well.  Good job - 10', '2005-08-06 02:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590256, 212846, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  I really looks like a nice, peaceful place to live.  Shows excellent depth with beautiful lighting.  I really like how the mountainous background disappears in the fog.  10</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  I really looks like a nice, peaceful place to live.  Shows excellent depth with beautiful lighting.  I really like how the mountainous background disappears in the fog.  10', '2005-08-06 02:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590270, 211224, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Unfortunately, this picture doesn''t really do much for me.  Lighting seems a bit harsh.   The subject too centered and boring.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Unfortunately, this picture doesn''t really do much for me.  Lighting seems a bit harsh.   The subject too centered and boring.', '2005-08-06 02:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590280, 212820, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice close-up.  Meets challenge well.</td>', 'Very nice close-up.  Meets challenge well.', '2005-08-06 02:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590286, 212119, 3669, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the yellow hue.  I think the diamonds would look more brilliant if the yellow was removed.  Also they appear to be slighting OOF.  Otherwise, this would have been a nice shot.  It is composed nicely.</td>', 'I don''t really care for the yellow hue.  I think the diamonds would look more brilliant if the yellow was removed.  Also they appear to be slighting OOF.  Otherwise, this would have been a nice shot.  It is composed nicely.', '2005-08-06 03:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590289, 212047, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, color, lighting and focus.  I like the angle at which this picture was taken.</td>', 'Nice texture, color, lighting and focus.  I like the angle at which this picture was taken.', '2005-08-06 03:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590296, 211307, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.</td>', 'Interesting subject.', '2005-08-06 03:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590305, 212813, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  Too bad in this challange that you couldn''t clone out the power line.  The trees frame the picture nicely.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  Too bad in this challange that you couldn''t clone out the power line.  The trees frame the picture nicely.', '2005-08-06 03:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
