(1590666, 212211, 36231, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, but ... :) Your horizontal line is crooked and the lighting is flat.  Probably would have done better with several light sources and a lighter background. Good luck!</td>', 'This was a good idea, but ... :) Your horizontal line is crooked and the lighting is flat.  Probably would have done better with several light sources and a lighter background. Good luck!', '2005-08-06 11:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590667, 212668, 36231, '<td valign="top">Wow ... I wanna live there! :)</td>', 'Wow ... I wanna live there! :)', '2005-08-06 11:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590669, 212870, 36231, '<td valign="top">This is such an awesome photo! Just a few things ... The pug is slightly out of focus, and it would be great just a little sharper.  As is, it''s an 8 in my book! Great job! :)</td>', 'This is such an awesome photo! Just a few things ... The pug is slightly out of focus, and it would be great just a little sharper.  As is, it''s an 8 in my book! Great job! :)', '2005-08-06 11:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590670, 211943, 25654, '<td valign="top">I wish your background was black , 10</td>', 'I wish your background was black , 10', '2005-08-06 11:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590675, 210989, 36231, '<td valign="top">That''s right!  Affluence is all perspective. I wish I had a pool, even like that ... But then again, I think I''m taking photos with my pool! :)</td>', 'That''s right!  Affluence is all perspective. I wish I had a pool, even like that ... But then again, I think I''m taking photos with my pool! :)', '2005-08-06 11:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
