(1590878, 212666, 30817, '<td valign="top">Sharp might be important in technical shots, advertising, macros and nature; but in interpretive works such as this, oversharpening can be a distraction.  The creativity, humor, in-your-face attitude and this super great kid all combine to make this one of my top ten favorites for this challenge regardless of the piece''s overworked look. ( My folks made me wear a suit just like that when I was 5  LOL)</td>', 'Sharp might be important in technical shots, advertising, macros and nature; but in interpretive works such as this, oversharpening can be a distraction.  The creativity, humor, in-your-face attitude and this super great kid all combine to make this one of my top ten favorites for this challenge regardless of the piece''s overworked look. ( My folks made me wear a suit just like that when I was 5  LOL)', '2005-08-06 13:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1590892, 211891, 41545, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-08-06 13:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
