(1591416, 211025, 30817, '<td valign="top">Of all the automobile shots in the challenge, none says "affluence" like the Rolls Royce; and of the 3 or so Rolls pix, this is the best.  You have captured the graceful symmetry and refined elegance of this "toy" for the wealthy. One of my top ten shots of this challenge.</td>', 'Of all the automobile shots in the challenge, none says "affluence" like the Rolls Royce; and of the 3 or so Rolls pix, this is the best.  You have captured the graceful symmetry and refined elegance of this "toy" for the wealthy. One of my top ten shots of this challenge.', '2005-08-06 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591417, 212312, 30817, '<td valign="top">The blue and red and of course, that great cat, all make for an ideal composition. One of my top ten favs of this challenge.</td>', 'The blue and red and of course, that great cat, all make for an ideal composition. One of my top ten favs of this challenge.', '2005-08-06 22:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591420, 211952, 30817, '<td valign="top">The lines are great for this composition, as are the lights that just twinkle with the message that these are the affluent on these decks. One of my picks to ribbon.</td>', 'The lines are great for this composition, as are the lights that just twinkle with the message that these are the affluent on these decks. One of my picks to ribbon.', '2005-08-06 22:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591433, 212688, 30817, '<td valign="top">Just based on humor alone, this would be one of my top tens for this challenge.  But I also like the bright tone of the composition as well as the attention to details you have given to your effort. And the dog? Well, when it gets back from the Republican fundraiser, give my regards.</td>', 'Just based on humor alone, this would be one of my top tens for this challenge.  But I also like the bright tone of the composition as well as the attention to details you have given to your effort. And the dog? Well, when it gets back from the Republican fundraiser, give my regards.', '2005-08-06 22:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591436, 212846, 30817, '<td valign="top">Affluent? Oh yeah.  Beautiful composition with superb elements throughout that all compliment the other.  One of my top ten picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Affluent? Oh yeah.  Beautiful composition with superb elements throughout that all compliment the other.  One of my top ten picks for the challenge.', '2005-08-06 22:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1591444, 212837, 30817, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this shows affluence so much as it shows following the trendsetters.  But then, that is probably one of the key elements to gaining affluence. One thing this IS, is well framed.  The wider lines on the left growing more narrow as the eye moves to the right is just very, very cool. And of course all those repetitive linear elements keep the viewer busy scanning each square centimeter of this gem. One of my top tens for this challenge and ... hey ... I think I spotted Waldo!</td>', 'I don''t know if this shows affluence so much as it shows following the trendsetters.  But then, that is probably one of the key elements to gaining affluence. One thing this IS, is well framed.  The wider lines on the left growing more narrow as the eye moves to the right is just very, very cool. And of course all those repetitive linear elements keep the viewer busy scanning each square centimeter of this gem. One of my top tens for this challenge and ... hey ... I think I spotted Waldo!', '2005-08-06 22:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
