(1595441, 212753, 15575, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but there are several things to improve on IMHO.  Firstly, the background is distracting - could change to plain black or similar.  By using black velvet etc, you''d also have no problems with the hot spot caused by the flash, to stop the motion of the notes.  Also, I''m not sure what that red line is, and there are other "interference" lines of some sort at the bottom of the pic, maybe noice??  It''s a really neat idea, I think you should give it a go again!</td>', 'Nice idea, but there are several things to improve on IMHO.  Firstly, the background is distracting - could change to plain black or similar.  By using black velvet etc, you''d also have no problems with the hot spot caused by the flash, to stop the motion of the notes.  Also, I''m not sure what that red line is, and there are other "interference" lines of some sort at the bottom of the pic, maybe noice??  It''s a really neat idea, I think you should give it a go again!', '2005-08-08 16:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
