(1596721, 212906, 25678, '<td valign="top">*yech* gas guzzling wasters!  Photowise, it''s a decent capture.  I wish the back of the limo could have been captured as well, and I''m not sure you had a choice, but a different reflection would also be nice.  I fin it a bit distracting since the reflection is fairly lighter coloured than the hummer.</td>', '*yech* gas guzzling wasters!  Photowise, it''s a decent capture.  I wish the back of the limo could have been captured as well, and I''m not sure you had a choice, but a different reflection would also be nice.  I fin it a bit distracting since the reflection is fairly lighter coloured than the hummer.', '2005-08-09 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596724, 212613, 25678, '<td valign="top">A little bit more sharpness would make this picture better.  Nice use of sepia</td>', 'A little bit more sharpness would make this picture better.  Nice use of sepia', '2005-08-09 00:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1596726, 212579, 25678, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2005-08-09 00:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
