(1597869, 212929, 30945, '<td valign="top">I love love love Hearst Castle-nice shot.  William Randolph exemplified the epitomy of affluence and extravagance.  He and architect Julie Morgan created a masterpiece for the 1920-1940''s era.  I used to live 45 minutes south of the castle- what a great place it is.</td>', 'I love love love Hearst Castle-nice shot.  William Randolph exemplified the epitomy of affluence and extravagance.  He and architect Julie Morgan created a masterpiece for the 1920-1940''s era.  I used to live 45 minutes south of the castle- what a great place it is.', '2005-08-09 13:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
