(1598176, 211988, 38921, '<td valign="top">On first look I though these were pay phones and was going to give you a 1 or 2 for not meeting the challenge description.  <br/> <br/>Meets Challenge: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Lighting: 1/2<br/>Subject impact: 0/2<br/> <br/>The harsh shadows on the faces detract from the shot and the composition is lacking impact.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'On first look I though these were pay phones and was going to give you a 1 or 2 for not meeting the challenge description.   Meets Challenge: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 0/2Lighting: 1/2Subject impact: 0/2 The harsh shadows on the faces detract from the shot and the composition is lacking impact.   ', '2005-08-09 16:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
