(1599844, 210457, 36628, '<td valign="top">I believe that the flare, if it was added in PS, would have DQ''d this image. I didn''t vote this challenge, but I really like your image. I suppose it is a little loose on the topic, but given the score its really not that bad. 15 out of 228 means you did something right :)</td>', 'I believe that the flare, if it was added in PS, would have DQ''d this image. I didn''t vote this challenge, but I really like your image. I suppose it is a little loose on the topic, but given the score its really not that bad. 15 out of 228 means you did something right :)', '2005-08-10 03:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
