(1599878, 210457, 38119, '<td valign="top">I rather liked this photo when I came across it in the voting. I think for the most part the culture reference was one that some might have not quite gotten.<br/> <br/>As for that edit version. I''m fairly sure the flare would have DQed. BUT I personally like the smoothed out look of her face from that Smart Blur. A few fine tuning adjustments on this could have easy brought in a ribbon.</td>', 'I rather liked this photo when I came across it in the voting. I think for the most part the culture reference was one that some might have not quite gotten. As for that edit version. I''m fairly sure the flare would have DQed. BUT I personally like the smoothed out look of her face from that Smart Blur. A few fine tuning adjustments on this could have easy brought in a ribbon.', '2005-08-10 03:14:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1599910, 210755, 41476, '<td valign="top">a weak photo that doesnt meet the challenge. Nothing special about the waters and could have been done by anyone with a long exposure camera. why do you think running water would have fitted the Affluence challenge? <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-10 02:26:51.</i></td>', 'a weak photo that doesnt meet the challenge. Nothing special about the waters and could have been done by anyone with a long exposure camera. why do you think running water would have fitted the Affluence challenge? ', '2005-08-10 03:25:46.000000', '2005-08-10 03:26:51.000000', 0),
