(1599968, 211451, 10084, '<td valign="top">The lines of the street leads the eyes toward the center of the image. The lineup of trees also bring the viewers eyes to this point. This causes the viewer to focus at that area where the road ends. Putting your main subject here would make it a good composition.</td>', 'The lines of the street leads the eyes toward the center of the image. The lineup of trees also bring the viewers eyes to this point. This causes the viewer to focus at that area where the road ends. Putting your main subject here would make it a good composition.', '2005-08-10 03:43:50.000000', NULL, 0),
