(1599998, 211451, 19831, '<td valign="top">The scene is a nice setting, but there are some points that are lacking. As mentioned, there are lines formed by the trees and road, but they take you out into the photo, and there is nothing there. In the dof here, the focus point seems to be on the car in the lower right corner, which is partially cut off, doesn''t come off as well planned or composed, showing all of that car (since it is the focus point) may be stronger. Possibly some tweaking in editing or changing the white balance setting could help, there is an off yellowish overcast from the street light. Also the big bright street light in the middle of the photo is a bit of a distracting element. And lastly, this was for the ''Affluence'' challenge, for many voters, the scene would appear to be of a pretty typical street and very average looking cars, doesn''t really convey the idea of affluence very strongly. This may be ''affluential'' to you, but you have to remember, this is a very international audience here, and to many voters, to get a high score you have to really nail the theme if you wish to score highly. You seem to have a good eye though, just keep shooting, participate here, study the comments you receive, get forum feedback, keep at it, I''m sure you''ll do well in the future :-)</td>', 'The scene is a nice setting, but there are some points that are lacking. As mentioned, there are lines formed by the trees and road, but they take you out into the photo, and there is nothing there. In the dof here, the focus point seems to be on the car in the lower right corner, which is partially cut off, doesn''t come off as well planned or composed, showing all of that car (since it is the focus point) may be stronger. Possibly some tweaking in editing or changing the white balance setting could help, there is an off yellowish overcast from the street light. Also the big bright street light in the middle of the photo is a bit of a distracting element. And lastly, this was for the ''Affluence'' challenge, for many voters, the scene would appear to be of a pretty typical street and very average looking cars, doesn''t really convey the idea of affluence very strongly. This may be ''affluential'' to you, but you have to remember, this is a very international audience here, and to many voters, to get a high score you have to really nail the theme if you wish to score highly. You seem to have a good eye though, just keep shooting, participate here, study the comments you receive, get forum feedback, keep at it, I''m sure you''ll do well in the future :-)', '2005-08-10 03:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1600000, 212846, 36999, '<td valign="top">I saw this during the challenge and was sure it was in Pagosa.  Lovely capture, the rain improved the mood!</td>', 'I saw this during the challenge and was sure it was in Pagosa.  Lovely capture, the rain improved the mood!', '2005-08-10 03:57:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1600003, 212901, 35467, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition. I think the people who made comment tell you why it did not do better, the green needs to be greener, the ball needs to be newer? or a better brand. The quirks of the DPC voters. I suspect you have of those photos which may well have done very well. Do not give up, learn and move on, if you wish to do well in challenges take careful note of the comments even when they seem rubbish. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Awesome composition. I think the people who made comment tell you why it did not do better, the green needs to be greener, the ball needs to be newer? or a better brand. The quirks of the DPC voters. I suspect you have of those photos which may well have done very well. Do not give up, learn and move on, if you wish to do well in challenges take careful note of the comments even when they seem rubbish. Keep up the good work.', '2005-08-10 04:00:09.000000', NULL, 0),
