(1600096, 210755, 27133, '<td valign="top">Okay...I will answer the obvious question here.  I live in the Outback where we are classed as drought stricken.  Water is restricted.  Farmers are really crying out for the available water.  Therefore this man made waterfall photographed in this area is a luxury....!  Now this may not make sense to city dwellers or people who do not have to succumb to water restrictions but try living without water.  It is a necessity, therefore water used in this form is showing affluency.<br/> <br/>Judi</td>', 'Okay...I will answer the obvious question here.  I live in the Outback where we are classed as drought stricken.  Water is restricted.  Farmers are really crying out for the available water.  Therefore this man made waterfall photographed in this area is a luxury....!  Now this may not make sense to city dwellers or people who do not have to succumb to water restrictions but try living without water.  It is a necessity, therefore water used in this form is showing affluency. Judi', '2005-08-10 05:14:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1600099, 212753, 32026, '<td valign="top">My idea was to get the money floating in "air". So I made long exposure and was moving camera down while making the shot. I had one test shot before and it was ok, but when I began making it for challenge I could not get it better. My idea was to get focused money on hard to understand background :(</td>', 'My idea was to get the money floating in "air". So I made long exposure and was moving camera down while making the shot. I had one test shot before and it was ok, but when I began making it for challenge I could not get it better. My idea was to get focused money on hard to understand background :(', '2005-08-10 05:15:32.000000', NULL, 0),
