(1600564, 212639, 20056, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments!<br/>This ribbon was totally unexpected... picture is not too bad technically but I did not come with a very original idea.<br/>I guess when You try enough times you get more chances :)<br/> <br/>The wine already disappeared but I will eat now the berries :)<br/> <br/>PS. Un lazo del ribbon se lo debo a Carlos, tycho y Arancha... me pusisteis los dientes muy largos ! :)</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments!This ribbon was totally unexpected... picture is not too bad technically but I did not come with a very original idea.I guess when You try enough times you get more chances :) The wine already disappeared but I will eat now the berries :) PS. Un lazo del ribbon se lo debo a Carlos, tycho y Arancha... me pusisteis los dientes muy largos ! :)', '2005-08-10 11:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
