(1600977, 211943, 32644, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''m really happy that this did so well. Thanks to all for the supportive comments.<br/>This was not a lucky shot as several believe. The ring is placed exactly where I wanted it using a nylon ''string'' to suspend it in the glass. I tried to get the liquid to look like Champagne, by using 7-Up, but the bubbles stuck to the ring. The liquid is water (wishing to be Champagne).<br/>The air bubles help to hide the ''string''. I waited until night to avoid reflections on the glass and lit the ring with a flashlight from above. I had to try over 100 exposures to get what I wanted. The background is a cream colored Satin pillow case.</td>', 'Wow! I''m really happy that this did so well. Thanks to all for the supportive comments.This was not a lucky shot as several believe. The ring is placed exactly where I wanted it using a nylon ''string'' to suspend it in the glass. I tried to get the liquid to look like Champagne, by using 7-Up, but the bubbles stuck to the ring. The liquid is water (wishing to be Champagne).The air bubles help to hide the ''string''. I waited until night to avoid reflections on the glass and lit the ring with a flashlight from above. I had to try over 100 exposures to get what I wanted. The background is a cream colored Satin pillow case.', '2005-08-10 13:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1601018, 212828, 36050, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for your comments and for the score. This is now my highest score in DPC.</td>', 'Thanks all for your comments and for the score. This is now my highest score in DPC.', '2005-08-10 13:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
