(1601317, 210807, 33560, '<td valign="top">I found the golden color to be completely apropos to the theme.  With the aid of the title, I was able to figure out that sometimes turning everything you touch into gold can have negative consequences. Social division is one.  And I thought the photo managed to make that point better with this set of color choices  - green and gold - than any other.  I like the photo  for the visual strength of its repeated elements, and for its unique color cast.</td>', 'I found the golden color to be completely apropos to the theme.  With the aid of the title, I was able to figure out that sometimes turning everything you touch into gold can have negative consequences. Social division is one.  And I thought the photo managed to make that point better with this set of color choices  - green and gold - than any other.  I like the photo  for the visual strength of its repeated elements, and for its unique color cast.', '2005-08-10 14:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1601320, 210457, 34217, '<td valign="top">I think this should have been in the top ten, it was my favorite of the group.  Great job.  Also I think you would have scored lower with the edited version.  It looks fake, to much photoshop work.  The original is awsome.</td>', 'I think this should have been in the top ten, it was my favorite of the group.  Great job.  Also I think you would have scored lower with the edited version.  It looks fake, to much photoshop work.  The original is awsome.', '2005-08-10 14:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
